.TH LIBMPQ__PATCH_FINISH 3 2026-09-28 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__patch_finish \- finalize and publish a staged patch archive
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__patch_finish(mpq_patch_s *patch);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Finalizes the staged patch archive and atomically publishes it at the output path supplied to libmpq__patch_begin(3). The base archive remains unchanged. This call consumes \fIpatch\fP whether it succeeds or fails; callers must not reuse the pointer. On a handled failure before publication, the temporary output is discarded.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns \fBLIBMPQ_SUCCESS\fP or a negative libmpq error.
.SH ERRORS
A NULL handle returns LIBMPQ_ERROR_EXIST. Finalization, close, and publication errors may also propagate.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__patch_begin (3),
.BR libmpq__patch_abort (3),
.BR libmpq__patch_replace_data (3)
